@ Traversable, traverse, sequence

~ "Setoid" equal
~ "Foldable" Foldable, size
~ "Functor" Functor, map
~ "Applicative" Applicative, of
~ "Apply" lift2
~ "Semigroup" concat
~ "Number" add, sub, mul, inc, dec
~ "Remainder" div, mod

.. Visit each value with a quotation that returns an applicative result, and collect those results in order.
.. Applicative already brings ap and map.
& Foldable f, Functor f => Traversable f
  .. Each value visited by a quotation that returns an applicative result. The results stay in order.
  traverse ( Applicative m => (f a) (a -- (m b)) -- (m (f b)) )

? "traverse order" < < < 1 3 > < 1 4 > < 2 3 > < 2 4 > > > [ < < 1 2 > < 3 4 > > [ ] traverse ]

.. The applicative of the traversable. The inner values stay in order.
: sequence ( Applicative f, Traversable t => (t (f a)) -- (f (t a)) )
  [ ] traverse

? "sequence arrays" < < < 1 3 > < 1 4 > < 2 3 > < 2 4 > > > [ < < 1 2 > < 3 4 > > sequence ]
? "sequence split" < < < 1 2 3 4 > > > [ < < 1 > < 2 > < 3 > < 4 > > sequence ]
? "sequence one" < < < 1 > > > [ < < 1 > > sequence ]
? "sequence six" < < < 1 2 3 4 5 6 > > > [ < < 1 > < 2 > < 3 > < 4 > < 5 > < 6 > > sequence ]
? "sequence odd" < < < 1 3 5 > < 1 3 6 > < 1 4 5 > < 1 4 6 > < 2 3 5 > < 2 3 6 > < 2 4 5 > < 2 4 6 > > >
  [ < < 1 2 > < 3 4 > < 5 6 > > sequence ]

. ..................................................................................................

# Traversable Array
  traverse = traverseArray

: traverseArray ( f a b. Applicative f => (Array a) (a -- (f b)) -- (f (Array b)) )
  over size
  dup 2 mod 0 equal
  [ 0 swap go ]
  [ evenTraverse  ]
  if

: foreign index_array ( ( Array a ) Num -- a )

: pair ( a a -- ( Array a ) )
  a b -> < a b >

: evenTraverse ( Applicative f => (Array a) (a -- (f b)) Num -- (f (Array b)) )
  dec 1 swap [ dup2 ] dip2 go
  [ [ 0 index_array ] dip call [ of ] map ] dip
  [ concat ] lift2

: go ( Applicative f => (Array a) (a -- (f b)) Num Num -- ( f ( Array b ) ) )
  0 -> drop drop2 <  > of
  2 -> go2
  _ -> goDefault

: go2 ( Applicative f => (Array a) (a -- (f b)) Num -- ( f ( Array b ) ) )
  rot swap [ index_array ] keep2 inc index_array
  rot bia [ pair ] lift2

: goDefault ( Applicative f => (Array a) (a -- (f b)) Num Num -- ( f ( Array b ) ) )
  dup 4 div 2 mul swapd . n idx m
  [ leftGo ] keep2 [ swap ] dip2 . n idx m
  rigthGo
  [ keep2 ] dip call
  [ concat ] lift2

: leftGo ( Applicative f => Num Num -- ( ( Array a ) ( a -- ( f b ) ) -- ( f ( Array b ) ) ) )
  [ go ] cons cons

: rigthGo ( Applicative f => Num Num Num -- ( ( Array a ) ( a -- ( f b ) ) -- ( f ( Array b ) ) ) )
  . n idx m
  [ add ] keep swapd . idx' n m
  sub . idx' n'
  [ go ] cons cons
